  "_howto": "One entry per MGnify genome catalogue. The 19 databases live in a single Zenodo record, DOI 10.5281/zenodo.21842023 (concept DOI 10.5281/zenodo.21842022 for all versions), CC0. `url` is the CORS-enabled per-file URL and `bytes` MUST match the file on Zenodo exactly — biomes.js compares the downloaded database against it and refuses a mismatch. Everything else comes from data/biome-dbs/manifest.tsv, where `species` is the genome count sylph inspect reported for the built database. An entry with an empty `url` still appears in the picker, greyed out, saying why; it is never dropped silently.",
